msgid "LAB_PURPOSE_OVERVIEW"
msgstr "Does the generated world have coherent oceans, continents and habitable land? Compare relief first, then land cover and vegetation."

msgid "LAB_DESCRIPTION_OVERVIEW"
msgstr "Relief is the foundation: it separates land from ocean and constrains climate, drainage and life. Click a region to inspect only the values relevant to that place."

msgid "LAB_PURPOSE_CLIMATE"
msgstr "Do latitude, elevation and time produce plausible heat and rainfall patterns? Step by 30 days to reveal seasonal movement."

msgid "LAB_DESCRIPTION_CLIMATE"
msgstr "Compare land and ocean temperature, humidity, precipitation and evaporation. The ocean should respond more slowly; broad belts should move smoothly without isolated seams."

msgid "LAB_PURPOSE_WATER"
msgstr "Does precipitation become soil water, surface storage and downstream discharge without appearing over dry oceans or vanishing instantly?"

msgid "LAB_DESCRIPTION_WATER"
msgstr "Step by one day and compare water depth with discharge. Water should collect in terrain-controlled paths and react after the climate forcing."

msgid "LAB_PURPOSE_ECOSYSTEM"
msgstr "Does biomass grow only where land, water, temperature and fertility permit it? Watch production before expecting total biomass to move."

msgid "LAB_DESCRIPTION_ECOSYSTEM"
msgstr "Vegetation carbon changes slowly. Net primary production is the faster signal: step by 30 days and compare it with fertility and plant types."

msgid "LAB_PURPOSE_LOD"
msgstr "Does simulation detail increase only around the selected focus while physical quantities remain stable across refinement transitions?"

msgid "LAB_DESCRIPTION_LOD"
msgstr "Click a point, choose Focus, then step one hour. Levels 5–7 should appear locally; Clear focus and step again to observe coarsening."

msgid "LAB_DESCRIPTION_ADVANCED"
msgstr "Advanced field selected. Its technical key and unit remain visible; interpretation depends on the owning simulation module."

